{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 53, :comments ["<b>And He led them</b> — that no enemy went out against them on the road from their departure until they came to the sea; therefore he mentioned, \"and covered their enemies the sea.\"" "And some say: <b>And He led them in safety</b> — on dry land when they crossed, and they were not afraid."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 78, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:15.825041438Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}